# Derived by hand: the clause's label reads the caller's `$t`, so the click that writes it changes the label in its tick (Semantics ch. 7).
test the_clause_follows_its_parameter

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="go")
    1: Ui.Label(text="some 3 x")

tick 1
  in:
    0: click
  changed:
    1: Ui.Label(text="some 3 y")
